    <string name="novabird_sync_import_title">Fetching mail</string>
    <string name="novabird_sync_import_intro">How far back and how many messages should NovaBird load for the imported accounts? The values from the PC are often small (e.g. 25 messages). You can change this later in the account settings under "Fetching mail".</string>
